                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you regarding your patient, a 34-year-old female, admitted on 23/11/2018 with acute right lower quadrant abdominal pain, nausea, and low-grade fever. Clinical examination revealed marked tenderness at McBurney's point with positive rebound tenderness. Laboratory findings confirmed leukocytosis, and abdominal ultrasound supported the diagnosis of acute appendicitis. The patient underwent successful laparoscopic appendectomy on 23/11/2018 without intraoperative complications. Histopathological examination confirmed acute appendicitis. Postoperative recovery was uneventful; the patient was mobilised early, tolerated oral intake well, and received appropriate analgesia and prophylactic antibiotics. She was discharged home on 25/11/2018 in good general condition. Please ensure wound review in approximately one week and removal of any remaining dressings. Should you have any questions, please do not hesitate to contact me.</div>
               </text>
            </section>
